invariant vote(N, V1) & vote(N, V2) -> V1 = V2
invariant chosenAt(Q, V) -> decision(V) | ~decision(V2) | V = V2
invariant chosenAt(Q1, V1) & chosenAt(Q2, V2) -> V1 = V2
invariant decision(V) -> exists Q. chosenAt(Q, V)

